 Round-trip transportation from Toronto\n* ⛽ Transportation costs\n\nThat's it — **just $50 for the concert AND the ride!**\n\n### 📲 RESERVE YOUR SPOT\n\nSpots are **very limited** because we're travelling in a Kia Soul.\nTo reserve your spot, send **$50 by e-transfer to:**\nnicolasbello@yahoo.com\n\nYour spot is only locked in once the e-transfer has been received.\n\n### 🍁 Come for the concert. Stay for the road trip.\n\nLet's make a night of it — great music, Niagara Falls, SiriusXM on the drive, and a fun Meetup road trip with a small group!\n\n**Friday, November 13 • 4:30 PM departure • Christie Station**\n🎶 **Roch Voisine + Niagara Falls + Road Trip = Friday night plans!**","eventType":"PHYSICAL","eventUrl":"https://www.meetup.com/toronto-movies-and-social-group/events/316750115/","isAttending":false,"isSaved":false,"maxTickets":4,"rsvpState":"JOIN_OPEN","featuredEventPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:536358065"},"displayPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:536358065"},"feeSettings":null,"group":{"__ref":"Group:5774262"},"socialProofInsights":null,"rsvps":{"__typename":"RsvpConnection","totalCount":4,"edges":[{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":true,"member":{"__ref":"Member:1936372"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:10807934"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:472993711"}}}]},"series":null,"venue":{"__typename":"Venue","name":"Christie Station Labyrinth","address":"Christie, 5 Christie St, Toronto, ON M6G 3B1, Canada","city":"Toronto","state":"ON","country":"ca"}},"RecommendedEventsEdge:{\"node\":{\"id\":\"316750115\"}}":{"__typename":"RecommendedEventsEdge","node":{"__ref":"Event:316750115","id":"316750115"},"metadata":{"__typename":"SearchMetadata","recId":"9ba2c7c1-f7ee-4f5e-ab01-898d274bb660","recSource":"ml-popular-events-nearby-offline"}},"PhotoInfo:451449891":{"__typename":"PhotoInfo","baseUrl":"https://secure-content.me